        "Shape this plan with Keating",
        "Start with filters instead"
      ],
      "text": "You know what you want to learn. Figuring out how is another job. You collect tutorials, save links, and ask questions. You’re still left deciding where to start, what you’re missing, and whether any of it is taking you where you want to go. Build your way through it with Keating. Bring your curiosity, what you already know, and what you want to be able to do. Shape a plan together, then change the depth, direction, and practice as you go. DESIGN YOUR LEARNING INTERACTIVE EXAMPLE How synthesizers make sound Starting from scratch. Curious about making music. How far do you want to go? Get the b",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
