      ],
      "text": "Explaining where you’re at. Again. You found a useful explanation last time. Now you’re piecing the context back together: what you tried, what clicked, and where you got stuck. Pick up with a teacher that has your history. Keating carries your goals and practice history into the next session. You can inspect and edit that context, shape the teaching instructions, and choose your model. See how to make it yours Learning context · example Working toward Build my own synth patch Last practice Changing the filter cutoff Next question How does an envelope change the sound? “Let’s build on the filt",
