        "Open your courses"
      ],
      "text": "You learned something worth sharing. Where do you even start? A chat transcript is a lot to hand someone. A pile of links leaves them finding their own way. And when you’re learning alongside others, your questions need somewhere to meet. Give what you know a place to grow. Build a course with lessons and practice, invite others, and work through it together. Join someone else’s course to follow their path, ask questions, and share what you discover. Example shared course Make your first synth patch You + your study group The learning path The conversation Start with a sound Listen, change the",
